  <rules>
    <rule name="Killzones" id="cda3-965b-c037-cc63" hidden="false">
      <description>During the game, you are able to set up Killzones across the board. 


At the start of the deployment step before any player has deployed any units, place a Killzone marker anywhere on the board more than 6&quot; from your opponents deployment zone. Enemy units within 6&quot; of the Killzone marker are considered in the Killzone.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
