                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Ranged weapons in this unit score a critical hit on an unmodified rolls of 7+. When firing at an enemy unit in a Killzone, ranged weapons in this unit score a critical hit on an unmodified hit roll of 6+.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
